            <property name="value">{"Condition":{"IsEnabled":"true","Subconditions":[{"AckStrategy":0,"IsEnabled":true,"IsGenerateEqualSubcondition":false,"Message":". Режим ''Имитация''","Severity":"152","Type":"On"},{"AckStrategy":0,"IsEnabled":true,"IsGenerateEqualSubcondition":false,"Message":". Режим ''Имитация''. Сигнал снят","Severity":"154","Type":"Off"}],"Type":"Discrete"}}</property>
          </attribute>
          <attribute type="unit.System.Attributes.InitialValue" value="false" />
